### 0 cli render groceries.wtf --format text
$ wtf render groceries.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[groceries] := table = 2 rows · 3 columns
| item | quantity | price |
| --- | --- | --- |
| apple | 2 | $3.30 |
| pear | 4 | $4.30 |

[total] := sum(groceries, quantity * price) = $23.80
[units] := sum(groceries, quantity) = 6
[average] := total / units = $3.97
Cost [total] $23.80.

